          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mundujo akumanyilile kulemwa kwakweko, apelece mbusi jamkolo jangalemala, ligongo lya ulemwa wakwewo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asajice ligasa lyakwe pa mtwe pa mbusi jambopesi jakwaŵenda AMBUJE kululucila ulemwa, ni ajiwulajile pa malo pakusapelecela mbopesi syakutinisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali atesile myoyo, jwakutaga mbopesi aloŵece cala cakwe m'miasi ni kujipaka pa misengo ja malo gakupelecela mbopesi syakutinisya, miasi jakusigalajo ajitaje pasi pa malo gakupelecela mbopesigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyosye mawuta gakwe gosope, mpela mwakusatyocesya mawuta ga mbopesi jamkamulano, ni jwakutaga mbopesi agajoce pa malo gakupelecela mbopesigo, kuti gakoposye liwungo lyakwanonyelesya AMBUJE. Jwakutaga mbopesijo ali atesile msyungu wakwaŵenda AMBUJE kuti amkululucile ulemwa mundu wambajo, AMBUJEWO tacimkululucila mundujo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
